{"id": "q-c16", "split": "dev", "setup": "cloud", "task": "qa", "retrieval_fact_hit": true, "latency_s": 8.475853299998562, "cost_usd": 0.0102571, "cached": false, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1792, "input_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 99}, "output_tokens": 1912, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1825}, "total_tokens": 3704}, "supported": true, "answer_shown": "Some farmers believe thunder to be the cause of the disease [S1]. It is spread easily by bacteria (microbes) that can be found in the gums secreted by the plant [S3]. They live in the plant’s interior [S3]. They spread by rain (splashing), tools, animals, and humans [S3].", "removed_sentences": [], "cited": [1, 3], "answerable": true, "qtype": "identify", "invented_quantity": false, "auto_correct": true, "facts_hit": 1, "facts_total": 1, "correct": true, "graded_by": "auto"}
{"id": "q-c17", "split": "test", "setup": "cloud", "task": "qa", "retrieval_fact_hit": true, "latency_s": 8.308130600009463, "cost_usd": 0.008742100000000001, "cached": false, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1787, "input_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 99}, "output_tokens": 1557, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1472}, "total_tokens": 3344}, "supported": true, "answer_shown": "It is spread by rain splashing, tools, animals, and humans [S3]. The bacteria are in the gums secreted by the plant [S3]. They live inside the plant [S3]. Plant cuttings are the biggest source of contamination [S3]. It develops well in high temperature and high air humidity [S3].", "removed_sentences": [], "cited": [3], "answerable": true, "qtype": "manage", "invented_quantity": false, "auto_correct": true, "facts_hit": 2, "facts_total": 2, "correct": true, "graded_by": "auto"}
