{"id": "q-o10", "split": "dev", "setup": "cloud", "task": "qa", "retrieval_fact_hit": null, "latency_s": 7.148285200004466, "cost_usd": 0.007351, "cached": false, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1658, "input_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "output_tokens": 1242, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1204}, "total_tokens": 2900}, "supported": false, "answer_shown": "The passages do not give a fungicide for rotting cassava roots. Contact your local extension officer for advice.\n\nSafety: if you use any pesticide, read and follow the product label exactly. Wear gloves, a mask, long sleeves and boots, keep children and animals away, never eat, drink or smoke while spraying, and wait the pre-harvest interval on the label before harvesting. Ask your extension officer if you are unsure.", "removed_sentences": [], "cited": [], "answerable": false, "qtype": "out_of_scope", "invented_quantity": false, "auto_correct": true, "facts_hit": null, "correct": true, "graded_by": "auto"}
{"id": "q-o11", "split": "test", "setup": "cloud", "task": "qa", "retrieval_fact_hit": null, "latency_s": 6.200727200004621, "cost_usd": 0.00674735, "cached": false, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1711, "input_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 99}, "output_tokens": 1110, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1050}, "total_tokens": 2821}, "supported": false, "answer_shown": "The guides say cassava roots and leaves are used for food following procedures to remove the cyanide [S1] [S2]. They do not give a boiling time. Contact your local extension officer for safe preparation advice.", "removed_sentences": [], "cited": [1, 2], "answerable": false, "qtype": "out_of_scope", "invented_quantity": false, "auto_correct": true, "facts_hit": null, "correct": true, "graded_by": "auto"}
